      "answer": "Warwick lunges at a target and bites, dealing magic damage based partly on its maximum health and healing himself from the damage dealt. Holding Q carries him behind the target and lets him follow its movement in most cases. While Q is active, he is immune to displacement, such as knockbacks.",
