      "answer": "Warwick senses enemy champions damaged below half health by himself or allies and follows their trails with bonus movement speed, which is temporarily lost in champion combat before rebuilding. He gains attack speed against targets below half health, and both speed bonuses grow stronger against very-low-health enemies. Activating W temporarily hunts the nearest enemy champion in its area and grants both bonuses against that target regardless of health.",
